WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.043 --> 00:00:02.670 line:0%
This name kept coming up.

00:00:02.712 --> 00:00:04.297 position:66% line:0%
Who is this guy that I keep hearing about?

00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:06.048 position:63% line:0%
He wasn't there, but he was right there.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.008 line:0%
<i>The record business, Hollywood,</i>

00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:08.718 line:0%
<i>civil rights.</i>

00:00:09.052 --> 00:00:11.387 line:0%
Anything that had to do with
the rights of people.

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.013 line:0%
That told you everything you
needed to know about him.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.348 line:0%
He was fearless, man.

00:00:14.557 --> 00:00:15.558 line:0%
Absolutely fearless.

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:17.893 line:0%
We needed to know him because
he was the gatekeeper.

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.187 line:0%
He knew everyone.

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:19.895 line:0%
Everybody!

00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:21.272 line:0%
Oh man, he was too fly.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:22.565 line:0%
One after another.

00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:24.150 line:0%
He became a powerhouse.

00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:26.110 line:0%
There's the power that needs
the spotlight,

00:00:26.152 --> 00:00:28.405 line:0%
but there's also the power
behind the scenes.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.115 line:0%
The guy's a rock, in every way.

00:00:30.157 --> 00:00:31.073 line:0%
Agent, manager.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.117 line:0%
Orchestrator.

00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:35.245 position:67% line:0%
This mysterious figure everybody respected.

00:00:35.287 --> 00:00:37.330 line:0%
You only find one of those people.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.207 line:0%
I'm like, how was the guy doing it?

00:00:42.043 --> 00:00:43.252 line:0%
Sometimes I say to myself,

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:45.088 line:0%
"How in the f*** did I get
into all of this?"

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:50.677 line:0%
I don't let nothing get in my way
about anything that I want to do.

00:00:52.512 --> 00:00:55.307 line:0%
Clarence was an African American
man in Hollywood,

00:00:55.473 --> 00:00:57.767 line:0%
<i>defying what Hollywood was
supposed to be.</i>

00:00:59.435 --> 00:01:01.145 line:0%
Black people are going to
move forward.

00:01:01.187 --> 00:01:04.315 line:0%
<i>No matter what business he was in,
he never wavered from his purpose.</i>

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:05.983 line:0%
Seeing that things were fair.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:08.110 position:56% line:0%
<i>He said, "Would you like any help...</i>

00:01:08.152 --> 00:01:10.530 line:0%
<i>...putting MCA into 
the black music business."</i>

00:01:10.613 --> 00:01:12.073 line:0%
I said, "Yes!"
He said, "Well thats good 'cause...

00:01:12.115 --> 00:01:13.492 position:64% line:0%
...I'm gonna tell you what to do anyway."

00:01:13.533 --> 00:01:14.825 line:0%
<i>I would hear about people,</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:18.747 position:56% line:0%
that were in very serious situations
when it came to life.

00:01:19.372 --> 00:01:22.917 line:0%
And they would say the only
person that can help you with this,

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:24.335 line:0%
<i>is Clarence Avant.</i>

00:01:25.587 --> 00:01:27.588 line:0%
Clarence is the bridge,

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:30.342 line:0%
<i>from a time where 
there was no opportunity,</i>

00:01:30.383 --> 00:01:33.177 line:0%
<i>to a time where doors
began to open.</i>

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.432 line:0%
He understands the bigger
that we are together,

00:01:37.473 --> 00:01:39.892 line:0%
<i>the bigger we will be
as a culture.</i>

00:01:41.102 --> 00:01:44.147 position:56% line:0%
Henry Aaron would not be Henry Aaron
if not for Clarence Avant.

00:01:46.817 --> 00:01:49.027 line:0%
The message that I
recieved from Clarence was

00:01:49.068 --> 00:01:51.153 line:0%
<i>just think about those kids
thats looking up to me.</i>

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.202 line:0%
The person that's
responsible for your transition,

00:01:57.368 --> 00:01:59.328 position:58% line:0%
<i>that's the key to changing your life.</i>

00:02:01.122 --> 00:02:02.998 line:0%
He became that mentor for us all.

00:02:03.207 --> 00:02:05.252 line:0%
<i>Became that godfather.</i>

00:02:07.628 --> 00:02:10.423 position:61% line:0%
<i>Remember the first time
someone ever said you're the godfather?</i>

00:02:10.673 --> 00:02:12.717 line:0%
Well people call me that,
people can call me anything.

00:02:12.758 --> 00:02:14.593 position:61% line:0%
People have called me a son-of-a-bitch.
So what?

